    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01e880dbffed0dff0fec19b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这都多亏了训练员。……在我烦恼是否要继续参赛时，\n是您一次又一次地，贴近我的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e133c89a18b8d8b76aad0a4a78a8b13d34d4c82ba7af4f29d466193f24e6b9d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b04d7914f679a131066e2519",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ead60c7960fdd7c8e7fa63a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅是对我，对任何赛马娘都是如此——训练员您，\n毫不吝惜地，将时间、能力，以及一切都倾注于大家身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ac452e254626b5a7df6ce6d22bb46c10709830ea096a68a98761c356422e7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b093d4a04ff39b86b5788207",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，那份温柔并不适合竞技——\n训练员们之间都是这样评价她的，我也一直有些担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "365c0eb1ba275cf2449d52fbfb3d531f56518fb43a8156c24c27006d4f247bec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135258e2a10b7e80defdd620",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cbf98a1e879a22005e55278",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再也找不到像您这样优秀的训练员了。\n我想向大家展示您的出色之处。——用我的奔跑来证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a440d3a570db8ad252ef17581d85bc3da61b8248e3546bca77de96763096ab76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f8156198f74e2ef146e537",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b459001269d6ee15d2ff2dfd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……虽然现在的我，连一朵象征胜利的花都无法献上。\n但是只要和您在一起——我就能，继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b0ae3dfa800e104574ca186cc3660860dab869dd4f8ad5c6ff4dd1d298318a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6cbef5b37c5530b0a6efdf6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
