      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c78713e619e9d53d256d87b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她那湿润的双眸微微颤抖着。然而，\n即使饱受不安的煎熬，那双眼睛依然直直地注视着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "820eae6210994d1440652a12f5c356368d4f5133f152c4eb7d66010c9c091bb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8cec42a635406b9fb7b4c03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我也想，对你而言",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3b56bacad8d7d7e55ce3a2d3521f19c4361a163496e278965e98123d28fc43b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f518970028113c9b21728d50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我也想，对你而言",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3b56bacad8d7d7e55ce3a2d3521f19c4361a163496e278965e98123d28fc43b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c88c1978457945e2889e39bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果错过了这个机会，她的才能也许永远无法展现出来了吧。\n而且，最重要的是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "23d19556e9d9d75307f3bb19b1fdeb5ff4daad5e3e22b3c6f506eaee933d9dfa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:341f2cb8de64143cc1462bdc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "努力成为最棒的训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3780c6fa7475d4b822e0665718b2d14bf0d29c17ab47cba3ba1213311b30b4ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cdb706d3065fcf82c298b3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使要改变自己，\n也下定决心想和我一起挑战的她——我想回应这份心意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "483d68a98b694c8ec8e437a3f7d42a70a3d4cf21cb8bd35583c7305263d72f2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
