      "uid": "zhcn:966fbb7dd30a93ff942b10de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看她之前似乎在迷茫是否该放弃比赛，\n所以我原以为她暂时不会考虑出道的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a8c67e4a321bca28903acffd9688c3129a5bebcd2018605e85d05ea7d3b8d64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
