    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:069dd17c83429e57264b0f14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她温柔地微笑了。如同花朵悄然绽放一般。\n——要让这闪耀的笑容美丽地绽放。我在心中暗暗起誓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c0b179787cd1845412b9efa266aebcadada452fb98cbe6e9fa68ee0387f832",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
